  {
   "version": "Introduced in House",
   "date": "2024-04-15",
   "text": "Gig Is Up Act \nThis bill requires businesses that have at least $100 million in gross receipts in a calendar year and with whom at least $10,000 individuals contract to provide services as independent contractors to pay both the employer and employee payroll tax contributions to Social Security and Medicare."
  }
